                <span class="jobdescription"><p>Requisition No: 844465 </p>

<p>Agency: Children and Families</p>

<p>Working Title: HUMAN SERVICES WORKER II - F/C - 60006360</p>

<p> Pay Plan: Career Service</p>

<p>Position Number: 60006360 </p>

<p>Salary:  $33,579.00 annually/$1,291.50 bi-weekly </p>

<p>Posting Closing Date: 04/20/2025 </p>

<p><b>Total Compensation Estimator </b><u><b><a href="https://compcalculator.myflorida.com/" target="_blank" title="Total Compensation Estimator">Tool</a></b></u></p>
<p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12.0pt"><span><span style="font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;, serif"><b><em><span style="font-size:14.0pt"><span style="font-family:&#39;Arial&#39;, sans-serif"><span style="color:black">Human Services Worker II</span></span></span></em></b></span></span></span></p>

<p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12.0pt"><span><span style="font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;, serif"><em><b><span style="font-family:&#39;Arial&#39;, sans-serif"><span style="color:#333333">Department of Children and Families</span></span></b></em></span></span></span></p>

<p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12.0pt"><span><span style="font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;, serif"><em><b><span style="font-family:&#39;Arial&#39;, sans-serif"><span style="color:#333333"> North Florida Evaluation and Treatment Center</span></span></b></em></span></span></span></p>

<p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12.0pt"><span><span style="font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;, serif"><em><b><span style="font-family:&#39;Arial&#39;, sans-serif"><span style="color:#333333">Gainesville, Florida<a name="_Hlk83304704"></a></span></span></b></em></span></span></span></p>

<p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11.0pt"><span><span><span style="font-family:Calibri, sans-serif"><b><em><span style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&#39;Arial&#39;, sans-serif"><span style="color:black">Open Competitive </span></span></span></em></b></span></span></span></span></p>

<p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12.0pt"><span><span style="font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;, serif"><b><span style="font-family:&#39;Arial&#39;, sans-serif"><span style="color:black">Vacancies in Forensic Services</span></span></b></span></span></span></p>

<p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12.0pt"><span><span style="font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;, serif"><b><em><span><span style="font-family:&#39;Arial&#39;, sans-serif"><span style="color:red">Evening and Night Shift positions will receive a $3.00 per hour shift differential</span></span></span></em></b></span></span></span></p>

